        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Printed in two shades of red, yellow, green, blue, brown, gray and black on glazed cotton.  Stripes, alternating wide and narrow, parallel to warp.  Wide stripe has blue ground with design of vases, each with three large roses and some smaller flowers.  Narrow stripe has scenes of Chinese figures with birds on stippled ground."@en ;
